  "_comment": [
    "Who the bots are: faction, race, and the names they get.",
    "",
    "The class/race table below is VANILLA's. Forever may well differ - Classic+",
    "servers commonly open up combinations vanilla never had - and if it does,",
    "this is the file to change. Nothing in the sim hard-codes any of it: a race",
    "is offered to a class only if the class appears in that race's list, so",
    "adding 'Shaman' to Dwarf here is all it takes to see Dwarf Shamans race.",
    "",
    "Names are built from per-race syllables rather than a fixed list, so a field",
    "of thirty never repeats and an Orc still sounds like an Orc.",
    "",
    "Icons are Wowhead's, the same source the calculator uses."
  ],

